# =====================================================
# GoTrips monorepo
#   gotrips-api   : Spring Boot (Maven, Java)
#   gotrips-admin : React + Vite (TypeScript)
#   gotrips-web   : Next.js (TypeScript)
#   docker-compose: PostgreSQL + 3 services
# =====================================================

# ---------- Environment / secrets ----------
